[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://bj564ax5hngs6"]

; The grappling hook: a launcher on the left arm, out of sight (no holster, not in a hand). Its
; slot's key (the fourth) uses it where it is (use: a press), and what a use does is the nodes
; under it:
;   Hook          CbItem    when used: says grapple.fired
;   Throw         CbProbe   a line along the look, flying at 80 m/s; let go by using the hook again
;                           or a jump, or after 2 s of holding
;     Rope        CbLink    to what the line found, reeled in at 4 m/s
;       Pull      CbForce   on the player, toward it: 160 m/s2 up to 15 m/s, ramped in, reacting
;       Hanging   CbMove    while it holds: gravity 0, air control 0.6, airborne
; They bake with the item into one motion, "Use". While that is on, its pack
; (animation_packs/hook_arm.tscn) moves the left arm alone: the right hand keeps its gun.

